Id: node-seedvr2
Title: SeedVR2 video upscaler
Does: Adds the SeedVR2 upscaler, which enlarges a clip by re-diffusing it with the frames kept consistent
 with each other, rather than upscaling each frame on its own. The catalogue's SeedVR2 workflows need it.
Target: custom_nodes/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler
Source: https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler
Rev: 4490bd1f482e026674543386bb2a4d176da245b9
Why: numz's SeedVR2 diffusion upscaler. Its loaders are what the catalogue gates the SeedVR2 slots on -- they
 list their whole model registry whether or not the weights are on disk, so presence of the PACK is the gate.
 Run unmodified.
Provides: comfyui-seedvr2-node
